		'id.without' => array(
			'en' => 'No ID with you? You can vote a provisional ballot. To have it counted, bring an accepted ID to your county election commission or county clerk by noon on Monday, November 9, 2026. Don\'t have an ID at all? Ask your county clerk for a free voter verification card. You\'ll sign a statement that you don\'t have an ID and bring papers that show your full legal name, birth date and home address.',
