		'polls_rules.phone' => array(
			'en' => 'No one may take photos or video inside the 75-foot limit around a voting location, so no ballot selfies at the polls. Take your sticker selfie once you\'re past the marked 75-foot line. A photo of your own mail ballot is a different case: Arizona law treats posting an image of your own ballot as your consent to share it. Never show another voter\'s ballot.',
